# Template for `strava.properties`. Copy this file to
# `strava.properties` (gitignored sibling, same directory) and fill in
# the credentials from https://www.strava.com/settings/api. See
# `docs/STRAVA.md` for the full registration walkthrough.
#
# This file is the primary source for BuildConfig.STRAVA_CLIENT_ID and
# BuildConfig.STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET — it overrides the
# LIGPSPORT_STRAVA_CLIENT_ID / LIGPSPORT_STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET env vars
# when present. Leave both empty (or delete `strava.properties`) and
# the Strava upload feature stays hidden in the UI.
#
# The secret is embedded in the APK: Strava requires client_secret for
# the token exchange and does not support PKCE, so there is nowhere
# else for it to live in a native app. Don't distribute a build that
# has real credentials baked in — anyone can extract them and act as
# your API application. Rotate on the settings page if that happens.
#
# The registered "Authorization Callback Domain" must be `localhost`,
# to match the `ligpsport://localhost` redirect the app uses.
client_id=
client_secret=
